OL,3,GNEWSAM4 junction closures and new Menai
OL,4,Abridge in plans to tackle congestion on
OL,5,AWelsh roads
OL,6,
OL,7,FJunctions on the M4 in Newport could
OL,8,Fclose, and a new bridge built across
OL,9,Fthe Menai Strait, as part of Welsh
OL,10,Fgovernment plans for two notorious
OL,11,Ftransport bottlenecks.
OL,13,FIt will also begin an 18-month project
OL,14,Flooking at a range of "roads-based"
OL,15,Foptions for the M4, that could include
OL,16,Fa new motorway or expanding the
OL,17,FBrynglas Tunnels.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
