OL,3,GNEWSAM4 junction closures and new Menai
OL,4,Abridge in plans to tackle congestion on
OL,5,AWelsh roads
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinisters are considering whether to
OL,8,Fclose or partially close three
OL,9,Fjunctions, potentially by 2028.
OL,10,FHowever, a review has warned that
OL,11,Fclosing them could cause increased
OL,12,Fcongestion and noise on alternative
OL,13,Froutes.
OL,15,FIt is not clear at this stage how
OL,16,Fanything would be paid for - the new
OL,17,FMenai crossing could cost up to #700m
OL,18,Fand take up to 10 years to be built
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
